  <item>
    <title>EnStory05-你被语言黑魔法硬控过吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67186bc50d2f24f2892a456b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67186bc50d2f24f2892a456b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Oct 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>语言的能量不可小看啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>定睛一看，生活里好多负能量都来自身边人的‘碎碎念‘：</span></p><span></span><p><span>“你多大年纪了，还不抓紧时间啊？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“我是你这么大的时候都已经……”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“别吃了，你还不减肥啊……”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“三十岁了，怎么办啊”</span></p><span></span><p><span>这何尝不是一种黑魔法的咒语？！语言就像养蛊一样，声音传进大脑，埋下焦虑的种子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你有用过什么招数应对？恐怕也只能魔法打败魔法了吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a> 年糕最近被黑魔法硬控住了...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 焦虑真的会传染，不要当情绪的垃圾桶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="663">11:03</a> 人心隔肚皮吗？战术回击：“不存在！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">12:41</a> 为什么一定要和身边最亲近的人作比较呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 红豆钝感力拉满，语言战场上防守最强</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a> 领导长辈的黑魔法真的让我浑身刺挠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1191">19:51</a> 不发疯打败不了魔法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1624">27:04</a> 你有什么白魔法？真诚地求助大家...</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐歌曲：Doja Cat-Say So</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/li5VpmPz5NuDx6_Vi2xSMy6zzVaT.m4a" length="22087451" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrajZvPy3zqE-2n29OMTV7D0pZzn.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EnChat12-杀我别用亲情牌，《姥姥的外孙》犯规了啊！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f3d1842adfe48b835a1fef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f3d1842adfe48b835a1fef</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Sep 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年暑期，一部从标题开始就很好哭的泰国电影上线，“大水”冲了电影院，《姥姥的外孙》全球热播中！</span></p><span></span><p><span>也许你已经看过太多 “大哭特哭”的影评，但你可能不知道的是，这部电影真正让人哭的，是泰兰德那个夏日，梦核般的旧房屋、渐行渐远的兄弟姐妹、堆在房间里的老照片还有姥姥种下的苹果树……</span></p><span></span><p><span>太多小细节等着被挖掘。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目哭到晕厥后乳腺畅通的年糕和红豆带你复盘这部黑马电影，一起回忆和家里老人度过的温馨时光，欢迎在评论区分享你的故事，要哭大家就一起哭吧！&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">03:54</a> 从哪个part开始落泪的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a>细节满满的call back真的好好哭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a> 全片最喜欢的剧情和台词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> 姥姥记得大家小时候发生的所有事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 爱在利益和生存面前显得太浪漫了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1509">25:09</a> “儿子继承遗产，女儿继承癌症”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1828">30:28</a> 大哥这个人物该如何理解呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a> 红豆与外婆的故事：每周200块钱“买来”的时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2648">44:08</a> 年糕与外公的故事：忘不了的那声“年儿，陪爷爷出去散步吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2974">49:34</a> 本期爆哭！！劝告各位，多多陪伴家里老人吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐歌曲：Billkin-永远</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhRf81FJx0ahPLvl8lKUdioB7dKO.m4a" length="39674800" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpfr7R106qKh_VtnhsJHlK9gsIRu.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EnChat11-大橘已定，当我把我的姐妹当作乙游攻略对象！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e3aae23a5ff0a0ca1d0b61</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e3aae23a5ff0a0ca1d0b61</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Sep 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有一天，你从这个姐妹的聊天框出来，点开下一个姐妹的聊天框</span></p><span></span><p><span>【宝贝，在干嘛？】</span></p><span></span><p><span>【宝，看我今天喝的奶茶！给你买一杯好不好】</span></p><span></span><p><span>【怎么还没出发，我现在特别需要你立刻马上！】</span></p><span></span><p><span>【55555我没有你怎么办】</span></p><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span>WAIT，这些对话</span></p><span></span><p><span>SOMETHING DANGEROUS！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>橘气冲天，橘式良好</span></p><span></span><p><span>当我把我的姐妹们比作乙游攻略对象，怎么的还有点好嗑呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>穿越走进晋江文学了，我嗑了我x我姐妹的CP，这下怎么着，你们来评评理吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 女人多真的是甜蜜的烦恼啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 年糕的1号对象：温柔骑士TV杯女主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> 年糕的2号对象：青梅竹马是个冰山美人儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a> 年糕的3号对象：霸道女总裁偶尔也会化身受伤小猫咪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 年糕的4号对象：快乐疯批小狗带你飞上天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 红豆的1号对象：活力四射小太阳，带来超多正能量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> 红豆的2号对象：南半球这位千金大小姐脾气有点大哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">19:18</a> 红豆的3号对象：完美小妈让人超级上头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> 红豆的4号对象：青梅竹马一直是温柔的陪伴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1498">24:58</a> 病娇体出场：“过去式”独占欲太强，跟谁都处不好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1574">26:14</a> 年糕的“过去式”真的把她当男朋友来对待，好窒息...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1732">28:52</a> 跟不同的女性朋友在一起，真的会有类似爱情的东西产生呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐歌曲：Aqua-Barbie Girl</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ln94Sn3uUgRSXFR2FlOmt5MkfeAp.m4a" length="23519813" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgziK-2U4ZHGsOY7bs_LgO8tobPX.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EnStory04-一起复盘魔幻赛博大战：乙游女对战哈圈男！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d96379ee04007d88569c6b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d96379ee04007d88569c6b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Sep 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>谁？谁要迫害未成年女性？</span></p><span></span><p><span>乙游纸片人？！</span></p><span></span><p><span>谁？谁出来为女性扬旗呐喊？</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈圈Rapper？！</span></p><span></span><p><span>你们不要再打了！不要再打了啦</span></p><span></span><p><span>年糕和红豆来带你们复盘复盘这个魔幻现实主义的赛博对战，你站哈男还是乙女？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 乙女游戏简单科普时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a> 乙女大战哈圈？两个完全不相关的圈子怎么打到一块儿的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 乃万犯了啥规矩：同担拒否</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 哈男爹味diss来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> 男性凝视就默许？“女性凝视”就跳脚啦？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1149">19:09</a> 纸片人老公上线了，律师函警告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> “嘻哈精神”被极个别污名化了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1469">24:29</a> 梁源，你这么爱教育人怎么不去考教资啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1732">28:52</a> 这下你们开心了吧，更想玩乙游啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期犀利，慎听！</span></p>]]></description>
