  <item>
    <title>EnChat09-致活在“社会时钟”里的你</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6698c4628fcadceb9032b4c3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6698c4628fcadceb9032b4c3</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Jul 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一生都热衷于设置Deadline的东亚人，从小就在“危机”和“赶工”中成长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>三十岁到底是个什么副本，没完成上岸、结婚、生子、买房、买车等等任务，是有怪物会吃掉我吗？退出这些年龄副本挑战，向我迎来的是永无止尽的茫然，还是如沐春风的舒畅？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在桎梏中生出翅膀，在自由中找寻方向。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tic Tok Tic Tok</span></p><span></span><p><span>是时候背叛这座“社会时钟”了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 你是爱做计划，设置deadline的人吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="272">04:32</a> 从什么时候开始，你意识到自己身处在deadline的环境中？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a>一些催促，都来自周围的“闹钟人”们！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a> 年糕步入职场的第一次焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">11:38</a> 红豆大学期间因为焦虑gap了半年，结果更焦虑了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="927">15:27</a> 羊群效应（集体化）—我就是想要和大家同步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1037">17:17</a> 都老师在外溜达也还是会产生焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a> 现在，你打破deadline的惯性思维了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1156">19:16</a> 年糕的恋爱课题-去你的吧，单身&amp;年龄焦虑！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1227">20:27</a> 做一件事情不快乐的话，为什么一定要完成？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a> 如果感觉到不对，就不要为了deadline硬着头皮向前冲啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1751">29:11</a> 有计划没计划可干VS有路没路可走？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2098">34:58</a> &nbsp;年初的flag倒了不要怕，祝大家都能快乐活过三十岁！</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐歌曲：伍佰&amp;China Blue-突然的自我</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsXj3RFH_DvQNkOQxnByMj6qp_0_.m4a" length="27100774" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:35</itunes:duration>
