  <item>
    <title>EnChat08-妹妹，成都city不city呀？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66879b290bc5d7cc7004c191</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66879b290bc5d7cc7004c191</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Jul 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>暑假去哪儿玩儿？成都？</span></p><span></span><p><span>嚯哟妖艳儿妖艳儿妖艳儿妖艳儿妖艳儿……</span></p><span></span><p><span>是褒义褒义褒义词哈年轻漂亮妖艳儿！</span></p><span></span><p><span>春熙路太古里宽窄巷子，</span></p><span></span><p><span>文殊院猛追湾东郊记忆，</span></p><span></span><p><span>火锅冒菜还有传统小吃……</span></p><span></span><p><span>来成都别只看大熊猫啦，土生土长的成都姐妹给你呈上最local的city walk路线。</span></p><span></span><p><span>来成都，松弛感拉满，fancy拉满，体重尽量不让你拉满。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="186">03:06</a> 酒店攻略：来成都玩儿住哪里最方便嘞？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> City Walk：东顺城南街-望福街-望平街</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">06:33</a> 老网红宽窄巷子还有必要去吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">10:48</a> 闹市里的静谧寺庙——文殊院</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a> 成都local推荐的川菜TOP 5：永乐饭店、轩轩小院、明婷小馆、转转会、马旺子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1308">21:48</a> 年糕对蛋烘糕的深情告白♥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1505">25:05</a> 贺记蛋烘糕，古希腊掌管蛋烘糕的神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">28:23</a> 一口气可以吃十碗的店！—西月城谭豆花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> 宵夜推荐小仙女！有超好吃的华丽丽炒饭和老妈蹄花儿！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1826">30:26</a> 成都夜生活热榜：兰桂坊、九眼桥、玉林路、猛追湾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 老工厂的朋克回忆：东郊记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐歌曲：谢帝-这才是成都</span></p>]]></description>
